  "object_result": "Actual native original logical, forall, strengthening and substitution proof-code production, specialized to both unchanged complete ZF/U tests. Every scope, formula, argument list and proof code ranges over all internal omega including nonstandard. Logical production consumes the original complete 27-pattern query. Forall consumes the original AbstractFreeTop execution with its actual successor scopes and binder lift. Strengthening uses the original successor scope and WeakenFree execution in its exact scope-removing direction. Substitution consumes the original mode-3 arbitrary argument-list execution. The unary rules consume genuine child Node and exact original free/conclusion fields. All four construct the original parent payload, validate the complete original local queries and recursive children, and construct Node/header plus Root at empty free scope. No supplied parent, local table, proof execution or external standardness. Existing syntax operations, original checker and original kernel are unchanged. This completes target proof-code constructors alongside accepted axiom and MP constructors; it does NOT prove the forcing-specific MP bridge, uniform interpreted six-rule preservation, uniform coded semantic/axiom correctness, InternalConsistency.reduction or final Con.",
